# 📜 AETHERIA — QUEST SYSTEM

> **A Quest is not simply an objective.**
>
> Every Quest is a part of the world.
>
> Completing a Quest can change Heroes, factions, resources, relationships, events, Town facilities, and even the state of the Tower itself.

---

# 1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW

Quest System adalah sistem yang menghasilkan, mengatur, menjalankan, dan menyelesaikan berbagai misi yang diberikan kepada **Master, Party, Hero, NPC, atau fasilitas Town Square**.

Quest terhubung langsung dengan:

```text
CORE WORLD BUILDING
GAME STATE SYSTEM
DATABASE SYSTEM
ID SYSTEM
TIME SYSTEM
RNG SYSTEM
MASTER SYSTEM
CHARACTER / HERO SYSTEM
AI CHARACTER + EMOTIONAL SYSTEM
AI FAIRY
ITEM + INVENTORY SYSTEM
PARTY SYSTEM
BASIC COMBAT SYSTEM
TRAINING GROUND
TOWN SQUARE
RECRUITMENT SYSTEM
STAR UP SYSTEM
EVENT SYSTEM
DUNGEON / TOWER SYSTEM
WORLD EXPLORATION
```

Quest tidak berdiri sendiri.

```text
QUEST
  ↓
GAME STATE
  ↓
WORLD / HERO / PARTY / TOWN / FLOOR
  ↓
CONSEQUENCE
  ↓
DATABASE
```

---

# 2. QUEST PHILOSOPHY

Quest di Aetheria tidak hanya digunakan untuk memberikan:

```text
EXP
Gold
Gem
Ticket
Item
```

Quest juga dapat menghasilkan perubahan dunia.

Contoh:

```text
Quest
 ↓
Save NPC
 ↓
NPC joins Town
 ↓
Town Facility unlocked
 ↓
Facility gets Leader
 ↓
Facility becomes operational
 ↓
New Quest becomes available
```

Dengan demikian, Quest dapat menjadi bagian dari **World Simulation**.

